==Strategy==
==='''Chapter 1'''===
One option is to destroy the enemy base before Teacher Bear and Shibalien spawn. Just destroy it with [[Cow Cat (Normal Cat)|Giraffe Cats]] and other fast attackers.

==='''Chapters 2 & 3'''===
Scissoroo poses no threat on her own, assuming you have [[Crazed Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Crazed Cat]] and [[Crazed Tank Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Crazed Tank Cat]]. Simply spam them with two other meatshields and any attackers that outrange Scissoroo.

